ary/30 transition-all group flex items-center gap-3\" href=\"/guide/how-to-name-your-crab/\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">📖</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">How to Name Your Crab — Complete Guide 🦀</span></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group flex items-center gap-3\" href=\"/guide/how-to-name-your-sugar-glider/\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">📖</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">How to Name Your Sugar Glider — Complete Guide 🐿️</span></a></div></section><section class=\"mt-12\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\">📝 Related Articles</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/international-animal-names-guide/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🌐</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Naming Tips</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">International Animal Names: A Global Guide to Pet Naming 🌐</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">How different cultures around the world name their pets. Traditional naming customs from 20+ countries.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/pet-naming-psychology-choose-meaningful-name/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🧠</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Naming Tips</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">The Psychology of Pet Naming: How to Choose a Name That Truly Fits</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Explore the fascinating psychology behind pet naming. Learn how names shape your bond, influence behavior, and discover science-backed tips for choosing the perfect pet name.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/best-animal-names-by-habitat/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🌍</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Naming Tips</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Best Animal Names by Habitat: Forests, Oceans, Deserts &amp; More 🌍</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Discover the perfect animal names inspired by different habitats around the world. From deep ocean dwellers to desert survivors, find names rooted in nature&#x27;s most beautiful landscapes.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/best-animal-names-by-color/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🎨</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Naming Tips</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Best Animal Names by Color: 200+ Ideas for Every Shade 🎨</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Find the perfect name based on your pet&#x27;s color! From snow-white names to midnight-black names, explore 200+ color-inspired animal names organized by every shade of the rainbow.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/best-animal-names-inspired-by-mythology/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">⚡</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Naming Tips</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Best Animal Names Inspired by Mythology: Gods, Heroes &amp; Legends ⚡</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Name your pet after the gods, heroes, and mythical creatures of world mythology. From Greek and Norse to Egyptian and Japanese legends, find powerful, meaningful names.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/animal-names-that-mean-strength/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">💪</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Naming Tips</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Animal Names That Mean Strength: Powerful Names for Mighty Pets 💪</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Give your pet a name that embodies power, courage, and resilience. Discover 150+ animal names that mean strength from languages and cultures around the world.</p></a></div></section><nav class=\"mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\" aria-label=\"Post navigation\"><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group text-left\" href=\"/blog/best-animal-names-for-endangered-animals/\"><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">← Previous Post</span><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary mt-1 line-clamp-1\">Best Animal Names for Endangered Species: 150+ Rare &amp; Precious Ideas 🌍</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group text-right\" href=\"/blog/animal-names-inspired-by-history/\"><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Next Post →</span><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary mt-1 line-clamp-1\">Animal Names Inspired by History: 150+ Timeless Ideas 📜</p></a></nav><div class=\"mt-12 p-6 bg-primary/5