red animal names.\\\",\\\"datePublished\\\":\\\"2026-06-18\\\",\\\"dateModified\\\":\\\"2026-07-06\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"BestAnimalNames Editorial Team\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://bestanimalnames.com/about/\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"BestAnimalNames\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://bestanimalnames.com\\\"},\\\"mainEntityOfPage\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebPage\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://bestanimalnames.com/blog/animal-names-from-different-cultures/\\\"},\\\"wordCount\\\":153,\\\"articleBody\\\":\\\" The world speaks thousands of languages, each with its own beautiful naming traditions. Drawing from world cultures gives your pet a name rich with meaning, history, and global perspective. Japanese Animal Names \\u003cstrong\\u003eKuma\\u003c/strong\\u003e (bear), \\u003cstrong\\u003eTora\\u003c/strong\\u003e (tiger), \\u003cstrong\\u003eSakura\\u003c/strong\\u003e (cherry blossom), \\u003cstrong\\u003eYuki\\u003c/strong\\u003e (snow), \\u003cstrong\\u003eSora\\u003c/strong\\u003e (sky), \\u003cstrong\\u003eRyu\\u003c/strong\\u003e (dragon), \\u003cstrong\\u003eHoshi\\u003c/strong\\u003e (star), \\u003cstrong\\u003eMochi\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eSushi\\u003c/strong\\u003e. African \\u0026 Swahili Names \\u003cstrong\\u003eSimba\\u003c/strong\\u003e (lion), \\u003cstrong\\u003eZuri\\u003c/strong\\u003e (beautiful), \\u003cstrong\\u003eJabari\\u003c/strong\\u003e (brave), \\u003cstrong\\u003eAmani\\u003c/strong\\u003e (peace), \\u003cstrong\\u003eSafari\\u003c/strong\\u003e (journey), \\u003cstrong\\u003eNala\\u003c/strong\\u003e (gift), \\u003cstrong\\u003eKito\\u003c/strong\\u003e (precious jewel). Celtic \\u0026 Gaelic Names \\u003cstrong\\u003eFinn\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eNiamh\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eAoife\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eCian\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eOisin\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eBrigid\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eRowan\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eLugh\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eMorrigan\\u003c/strong\\u003e. Nordic \\u0026 Scandinavian Names \\u003cstrong\\u003eFreya\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eLoki\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eOdin\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eThor\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eSven\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eAstrid\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eBjorn\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eSigrid\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eFenrir\\u003c/strong\\u003e. Sanskrit \\u0026 Indian Names \\u003cstrong\\u003eBodhi\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eKali\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eShanti\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eDevi\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eRavi\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003ePriya\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eAsha\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eIndra\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eRaj\\u003c/strong\\u003e. Native American Names Explore our name generators for {antechinus}, {alligator-gar}, {aldabra-giant-tortoise}, {african-civet}, and {arabian-wolf} to find the perfect name for your companion. \\u003cstrong\\u003eDakota\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eCheyenne\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eWinona\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eKiona\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eNokomis\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eTakoda\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003ePaco\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eMika\\u003c/strong\\u003e. Discover more naming ideas: {sandhill-crane}, {peterbald}, {zebra-moray}, {caribbean-flamingo}, {canary}, and hundreds more animal name generators.\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"https://bestanimalnames.com/images/og/blog-animal-names-from-different-cultures.png\\\",\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en\\\"}\"])</script><sc